--- !u!1001 &618857036
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questUI
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1065283733}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questText
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1194501153}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueMode
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: screenSpaceDialogue
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1434281201}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: "NPC: You saved me\u2026 I owe you my life. But my wife they took her.
        East of here, there\u2019s a tower. They\u2019ve turned it into a prison. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "NPC: She held off the soldiers so the children could escape. That\u2019s
        Wing Tsun not about overpowering but standing with purpose. Using position
        and intent, not force. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "NPC: You won\u2019t be able to charge in. The tower is guarded by soldiers
        trained to react to aggression. You\u2019ll need to redirect their energy,
        use timing, and recover the centreline in close quarters. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: "NPC: There are multiple checkpoints. If they surround you, don\u2019t
        fight harder move smarter. Control the space, manage your angles. Use their
        momentum against them. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: "NPC: Please... she believed in this art. In what it means to protect
        others. If anyone can reach her, it\u2019s you. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 996368872801064597, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: "Player: I\u2019ll bring her back and I\u2019ll use what she stood for
        to do it. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3541975952227237378, guid: 21d7e91ab3d6b1e4085071d2577ad301, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 118.54277
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
