  dialogueUI: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - 'Anthol was once a symbol of peace. Now his power is fear. '
  - 'His enforcers patrol these streets with reckless force unfocused, aggressive,
    and scared. That makes them dangerous. '
  - "To face them, you\u2019ll need discipline. First, you\u2019ll confront a lone
    guard redirect their attack, take control without unnecessary strikes. "
  - "Next, two more. They\u2019ll try to flank you. Stay grounded. Use footwork to
    reposition and maintain the centreline. "
